    <strong>An MBA in communication, media and advertising leads to roles in brand management, media planning, public relations and content, and rewards writing, audience insight and the ability to show results.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
